[
  {
    "builtin_name": "odoo_calculator",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "81ff5b5c9e0666320e7e325a8746611f6aa73b9c5b3f6fd9e64f5a97af0daee0",
        "value": "安全计算数学表达式，支持 +、-、*、/、括号和基本算术，以字符串返回计算结果。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "3d828cca0c8e15a97fe405f9b065d1c9ff4d0e8e6ccff3baaaedb4b713992407",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"expression\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u8981\\u8ba1\\u7b97\\u7684\\u6570\\u5b66\\u8868\\u8fbe\\u5f0f\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982 12 * (3 + 4) / 2\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"expression\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "odoo_web_search",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "e7aa89649510437f56a789c26982347078ef2e3b4ce839ad94cc8967c5f6fbdb",
        "value": "搜索网络上的最新信息。使用无需 API 密钥的 DuckDuckGo，Bing 和 Brave 作为备用来源。返回标题、摘要和网址，适合查找文档、新闻及其他网络信息。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "89b845410adefd5296b8621b064d309975ec28682cd447c5821a89d80add9044",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"query\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"description\": \"\\u641c\\u7d22\\u95ee\\u9898\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982\\u201c\\u6700\\u65b0 Odoo 18 \\u53d1\\u5e03\\u8bf4\\u660e\\u201d\\u3002\"}, \"max_results\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u7ed3\\u679c\\u6570\\u91cf\\u4e0a\\u9650\\uff0c\\u8303\\u56f4 1\\u201315\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 5\\u3002\"}, \"recency\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"day\", \"week\", \"month\", \"year\"], \"description\": \"\\u6309\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u9650\\u5236\\u7ed3\\u679c\\uff0c\\u7559\\u7a7a\\u8868\\u793a\\u4e0d\\u9650\\u3002\\u65b0\\u95fb\\u3001\\u53d1\\u5e03\\u52a8\\u6001\\u7b49\\u5177\\u6709\\u65f6\\u6548\\u6027\\u7684\\u95ee\\u9898\\u5e94\\u6307\\u5b9a\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u8303\\u56f4\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"query\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "odoo_fetch_url",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "d56aa1aafb4dab01b87ea45ae0aafbe0028e9559a07700820e93f678b5402e43",
        "value": "读取网址并返回可读正文，支持网页正文（排除菜单和 Cookie 提示）、带文字层的 PDF、YouTube 视频字幕。跟随 HTTP 重定向与页面刷新跳转，阻止私有地址、回环地址和云元数据地址。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "7aae0315784070bd83b7dd9eb94fee0008a6639a3035a2aa333feebc6e59e92e",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"url\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u8981\\u8bfb\\u53d6\\u7684\\u5b8c\\u6574\\u7f51\\u5740\\uff0c\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u5305\\u542b http:// \\u6216 https://\\u3002\"}, \"max_length\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u6b63\\u6587\\u6700\\u591a\\u5b57\\u7b26\\u6570\\uff0c\\u8303\\u56f4 1000\\u201320000\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 5000\\u3002\"}, \"prompt\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u8bf4\\u660e\\u8981\\u67e5\\u627e\\u7684\\u5185\\u5bb9\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982\\u201c\\u4e0a\\u4f20\\u91cd\\u8bd5\\u7684\\u8d85\\u65f6\\u65f6\\u95f4\\u201d\\u3002\\u8be5\\u53c2\\u6570\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u67e5\\u8be2\\u610f\\u56fe\\uff0c\\u4e0d\\u7b5b\\u9009\\u7ed3\\u679c\\uff0c\\u4ecd\\u4f1a\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u5b8c\\u6574\\u6b63\\u6587\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"url\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "news_fetch",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "d861401e444ab82c6250a9db4aab1f07fa93eaac0f0be6753ed891ee343f577c",
        "value": "读取并解析指定 RSS/Atom 地址，返回规范化条目：title、url、published、summary。接收网址并返回数据；新闻来源清单由智能体技能维护。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "a5e4488f7d0f4d810efe50eaf90b9589c0853d29e1c18c4b14c058d3bdb70f67",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"url\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"description\": \"\\u8ba2\\u9605\\u6e90\\u5730\\u5740\\uff0c\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u5305\\u542b http:// \\u6216 https://\\u3002\"}, \"limit\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u9879\\u76ee\\u6570\\u91cf\\u4e0a\\u9650\\uff0c\\u8303\\u56f4 1\\u2013100\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 20\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"url\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "news_digest",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "a73cab1091aaabd0345f458d9334a679370624400c9ae969fe6c6704cf23b87b",
        "value": "读取或保存用户在 ai.personal.memory 中的当天新闻简报缓存。未传 digest_text 时读取缓存，无需调用模型；传入 digest_text 时保存当天简报。简报属于个人记忆，可跨 AI 员工和会话使用。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "9679ffe53274c87ea22940b149b7533ff133f771b176d2b77b3f36b1089a8af1",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"topic\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u53ef\\u9009\\u4e3b\\u9898\\u7b5b\\u9009\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982 AI\\uff1b\\u7559\\u7a7a\\u8868\\u793a\\u5168\\u90e8\\u3002\"}, \"count\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"\\u65b0\\u95fb\\u6761\\u6570\\u4e0a\\u9650\\uff0c\\u8303\\u56f4 1\\u201350\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 10\\u3002\"}, \"digest_text\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u8981\\u7f13\\u5b58\\u7684\\u7b80\\u62a5\\u5185\\u5bb9\\uff0c\\u7559\\u7a7a\\u65f6\\u8bfb\\u53d6\\u7f13\\u5b58\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": []}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "personal_memory",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "1f2de94f9dae637f211ce6a91ba32dc19e4b1b49bd1618e246f27a9f73d7c2b7",
        "value": "读写用户的个人记忆 ai.personal.memory，包含偏好、事实和洞察，可跨 AI 员工与会话保留。action=write 保存用户明确提供的信息，例如“只要五条新闻”存为 category=preference；action=search 按 query 查找；action=recent 获取最近记忆。用于让偏好在后续会话中继续生效。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "d9cbecb3609698991209be7360c20977b6d8ca8fc4b450474e9dfe41e2578b6b",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"write\", \"search\", \"recent\"], \"description\": \"write \\u4fdd\\u5b58\\u5185\\u5bb9\\uff0csearch \\u6309\\u5173\\u952e\\u8bcd\\u67e5\\u627e\\uff0crecent \\u8bfb\\u53d6\\u6700\\u8fd1\\u8bb0\\u5fc6\\u3002\"}, \"content\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"action=write \\u65f6\\u5fc5\\u586b\\u7684\\u8bb0\\u5fc6\\u5185\\u5bb9\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982\\u201c\\u7528\\u6237\\u5e0c\\u671b\\u65b0\\u95fb\\u7b80\\u62a5\\u5305\\u542b\\u4e94\\u6761\\u65b0\\u95fb\\u201d\\u3002\"}, \"query\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"action=search \\u65f6\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u7684\\u67e5\\u8be2\\u8bcd\\uff0c\\u7559\\u7a7a\\u8868\\u793a\\u6700\\u65b0\\u8bb0\\u5fc6\\u3002\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"fact\", \"preference\", \"goal\", \"correction\", \"pattern\", \"feedback\", \"context\", \"insight\", \"policy\", \"skill\"], \"description\": \"\\u8bb0\\u5fc6\\u7c7b\\u578b\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 fact\\uff1b\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u7528\\u6237\\u504f\\u597d\\u65f6\\u4f7f\\u7528 preference\\u3002\"}, \"importance\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"], \"description\": \"\\u8bb0\\u5fc6\\u7684\\u91cd\\u8981\\u7a0b\\u5ea6\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 medium\\u3002\"}, \"source_ref\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u53ef\\u9009\\u6765\\u6e90\\u5f15\\u7528\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982\\u65b0\\u95fb\\u94fe\\u63a5\\u3002\"}, \"limit\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"search \\u6216 recent \\u7684\\u6700\\u591a\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u6761\\u6570\\uff0c\\u8303\\u56f4 1\\u201350\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 10\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"action\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "browser_navigate",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "57fa8e2f8240b9c2564e8d59d58f65794491b0603f873fa90a241bded93f4f93",
        "value": "通过无界面浏览器打开网址并返回完整页面正文，适用于需要 JavaScript 渲染的网站、网站可用性检查和动态页面内容提取。通过 NATS 委派给 Pi 智能体。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "9b93fd354af48df5a2abcfe9120facb7a8f1643dde9d4d1580c222dfaee430d0",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"url\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u8981\\u6253\\u5f00\\u7684\\u7f51\\u5740\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982 https://example.com\\u3002\"}, \"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"snapshot\", \"screenshot\", \"check_uptime\"], \"description\": \"\\u9875\\u9762\\u64cd\\u4f5c\\uff1asnapshot \\u8bfb\\u53d6\\u6b63\\u6587\\uff0cscreenshot \\u622a\\u56fe\\uff0ccheck_uptime \\u68c0\\u67e5\\u9875\\u9762\\u80fd\\u5426\\u52a0\\u8f7d\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"url\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "graph_query",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "f25c8d27dff0955581aea32e12536c63a8ef3c51c590640ba73234a6535f15c1",
        "value": "使用 Cypher 只读查询 Odoo Mind 图数据库，查找联系人、公司、邮件、发票、战略计划和知识文章之间的关系，返回节点和关系的 JSON。示例：MATCH (p:OdooPartner {id: 42})-[:HAS_CONTACT]->(person) RETURN person.name, person.email。只读，不能修改数据。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "eeaf6e3511b8972be76f60be8cacc9b28738627ed8b3ba96665b44c604c47b74",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"query\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u53ea\\u8bfb Cypher \\u67e5\\u8be2\\uff0c\\u4ec5\\u5141\\u8bb8 MATCH\\u3001RETURN\\u3002\\u793a\\u4f8b\\uff1aMATCH (p:OdooPartner)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(c:Company {id: 1}) RETURN p.name\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"query\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "graphify_search",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "570dc8e290c10ff40e842518a4d35a6b133424f30323dcf4ffcdcb78abe0f656",
        "value": "搜索由 graphify 索引的 OCA 模块和内部仓库，适用于查找可用模块或已有解决方案。返回模块名、说明和相关度，通过 NATS 委派给 Pi 智能体。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "2fa5f4f80b19cb03c1f37466ac83d964301a18567c3371052453d5dbfac096a2",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"query\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u641c\\u7d22\\u8bcd\\u3002\"}, \"repos\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"description\": \"\\u4ed3\\u5e93\\u7b5b\\u9009\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982 [\\\"oca/*\\\"]\\u3002\"}, \"limit\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"\\u6700\\u591a\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u6761\\u6570\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 5\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"query\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "pi_unified_recall",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "a110aebe95aa0ee790534ea080a4f06ab5afa8aea1014cb1b1ff92adcd8bdb01",
        "value": "跨 Odoo Mind 与外部 graphify、文件系统等来源进行综合检索，覆盖 Odoo 内部数据和外部知识。返回排序后的结果及来源，通过 NATS 委派给 Pi 智能体。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "79d1ef4c5440dc04fc2e9232c43ca078959cbeb43e491e1055c5c956fb1c28bb",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"query\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u641c\\u7d22\\u8bcd\\u3002\"}, \"sources\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"description\": \"\\u6765\\u6e90\\u6807\\u8bc6\\uff1ainternal\\u3001graphify\\u3001filesystem \\u6216 all\\u3002\"}, \"strategy\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"precision\", \"balanced\", \"recall\", \"detective\"], \"description\": \"\\u641c\\u7d22\\u7b56\\u7565\\u3002\"}, \"limit\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"\\u6700\\u591a\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u6761\\u6570\\uff0c\\u9ed8\\u8ba4 10\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"query\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "echo",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "c929a62e4d1a498a5e80670e6eff662eb64eb59f125077f4752ee991664b7b2c",
        "value": "原样返回消息，用于测试。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "6c5a5fec67fd0f20408d2a13a81a52541dea117a8efb0ae56ec4e7d6dee28850",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"message\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u8981\\u539f\\u6837\\u8fd4\\u56de\\u7684\\u6d88\\u606f\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"message\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "nats_publish",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "1362e8b306d7bbe0a221244dbd62beb58eaccd17345615d0f55ce55e2330dd96",
        "value": "向 NATS 主题发布消息，由 Pi 工作进程领取。用于将命令执行、部署、监控等基础设施任务委派给远程 Pi 智能体，返回确认或错误。"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "source_sha256": "c38027f555c1e3cea95f9a24b0b43877196e58b5f59e1382a82b1ce6f377360f",
        "value": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"subject\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u8981\\u53d1\\u5e03\\u7684 NATS \\u4e3b\\u9898\\uff0c\\u4f8b\\u5982 pi.task.new \\u6216 pi.task.assign.{host}\\u3002\"}, \"task_id\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"\\u8ddf\\u8e2a\\u4efb\\u52a1\\u7ed3\\u679c\\u7684\\u552f\\u4e00\\u4efb\\u52a1 ID\\u3002\"}, \"prompt\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"\\u4ea4\\u7ed9\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u8fdb\\u7a0b\\u6267\\u884c\\u7684\\u4efb\\u52a1\\u6307\\u4ee4\\u3002\"}, \"skills\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"description\": \"\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u8fdb\\u7a0b\\u5e94\\u52a0\\u8f7d\\u7684\\u6280\\u80fd\\u540d\\u79f0\\u5217\\u8868\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u9009\\u3002\"}}, \"required\": [\"subject\", \"task_id\", \"prompt\"]}"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "inventory_architecture",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "33975f2c639066e71643057f3ee01c9f505bc1938bd6a9cd42a991a95ed4bd41",
        "value": "返回完整系统架构，包括 ai.* 模型的字段和关系、init_types，以及已安装 ai_* 模块的 MODULE.md 文档。"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "builtin_name": "inventory_quests",
    "fields": {
      "description": {
        "source_sha256": "836067f252ae0fa1be8964396c1ccba5992091176e7b4bc4d3038180c952b0a4",
        "value": "列出所有有效的 ai.coworker 记录，包含名称、状态和 init_type。"
